summary:
  sameDoor folds the scheme away, so a station that left https for http counts
  as not having moved.

history:
  The commit's check for the same address used addrKey, which folds scheme and
  case. A station whose TLS port closed was found on plain http, played and
  never saved: every later play went through the error and the heal again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
          return m ? m[1].toLowerCase() + m[2].toLowerCase() + m[3].replace(/\/$/, "") : "";

replace:
          return m ? m[2].toLowerCase() + m[3].replace(/\/$/, "") : "";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_heallogic.qml::test_the_same_door_is_the_same_scheme_host_and_path.
  Line-neutral.
